# Audit Log API Endpoints

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/audit-log
@accessToken = YOUR_ACCESS_TOKEN_HERE
@companyId = YOUR_COMPANY_ID_HERE
@auditLogId = YOUR_AUDIT_LOG_ID_HERE

### 1. Get Filtered Audit Trail
GET {{baseUrl}}?companyId={{companyId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 2. Filter Audit Trail by Module (e.g. INVOICE, AUTH)
GET {{baseUrl}}?companyId={{companyId}}&module=INVOICE
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 3. Filter Audit Trail by Action Type (e.g. CREATE, UPDATE, DELETE, LOGIN_SUCCESS)
GET {{baseUrl}}?companyId={{companyId}}&actionType=LOGIN_SUCCESS
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 4. Filter Audit Trail by Date Range
GET {{baseUrl}}?companyId={{companyId}}&from=2026-08-01T00:00:00.000Z&to=2026-08-31T23:59:59.000Z
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 5. Filter Audit Trail with Pagination
GET {{baseUrl}}?companyId={{companyId}}&page=1&limit=10
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 6. Get Single Audit Log Details
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{auditLogId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

### 7. Attempt to Update Audit Log (Should fail - Route not defined / blocked)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{auditLogId}}
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}

{
  "description": "Malicious description modification"
}

### 8. Attempt to Delete Audit Log (Should fail - Route not defined / blocked)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{auditLogId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{accessToken}}
